:\"Remove or fix the rug at Hallway door against the wall so the edge lies flat.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊門口靠牆的地毯移除或固定，使邊緣平貼地面。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_d891117a-6570-49a7-93a4-a0f644d1380b","call_id":"call_d891117a-6570-49a7-93a4-a0f644d1380b","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H3\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the black cable off the walkway at Hallway door and secure it along the wall.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊門口的黑色電線移出走道，沿牆固定收好。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_26d04de9-6c42-40d1-b977-7b8802c5a821","call_id":"call_26d04de9-6c42-40d1-b977-7b8802c5a821","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H4\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the cable and power strip cord off the threshold at Hallway door.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊門口門檻上的電線及延長線移開並收好。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_c5e71036-4e77-453e-8de5-2586f8fe2d05","call_id":"call_c5e71036-4e77-453e-8de5-2586f8fe2d05","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H5\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the cable with plug off the tiled floor in Hallway to bathroom.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊往浴室地上有插頭的電線移開走道並收好。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_bef5c40f-7cb1-41ff-9e68-898957150709","call_id":"call_bef5c40f-7cb1-41ff-9e68-898957150709","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H6\",\"instruction_en\":\"Remove the white sneakers from the walkway in Hallway to bathroom and store them in a shoe cabinet.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊往浴室走道上的白色運動鞋移開，收到鞋櫃。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_2c752993-772c-43dd-a3ca-7be67dee1cc7","call_id":"call_2c752993-772c-43dd-a3ca-7be67dee1cc7","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H7\",\"instruction_en\":\"Clear the white sneakers from the walkway in Hallway to bathroom to keep the path open.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊往浴室走道上的白色運動鞋清除，保持走道淨空。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_c1918a29-dd99-4afe-b69f-b3cd0e0f780f","call_id":"call_c1918a29-dd99-4afe-b69f-b3cd0e0f780f","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H8\",\"instruction_en\":\"Remove the blue slippers from the walkway in Hallway to bathroom.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊往浴室走道上的藍色拖鞋移開。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_0ecbff65-1d19-45ef-af17-f7476a8b71dc","call_id":"call_0ecbff65-1d19-45ef-af17-f7476a8b71dc","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H9\",\"instruction_en\":\"Clear the pair of blue slippers from the walkway in Hallway to bathroom.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊往浴室走道上的一雙藍色拖鞋清除。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_e8847b46-8c77-46b3-af40-ae3ed3c9d6d5","call_id":"call_e8847b46-8c77-46b3-af40-ae3ed3c9d6d5","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H10\",\"instruction_en\":\"Install anti-slip treatment on the wet floor area in Bathroom.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"在浴室積水處的地板設置防滑措施。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"FA35\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_6c66b498-3245-4def-9181-2263bca7db4a","call_id":"call_6c66b498-3245-4def-9181-2263bca7db4a","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H11\",\"instruction_en\":\"Install a fixed grab bar beside the toilet in Bathroom.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"在浴室馬桶旁安裝固定式扶手。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"FA22\"}","status":"completed"}]